    "since": "2015",
    "towerM": 26,
    "text": {
      "en": "Stands at Liisalanperä near Kintaus in Petäjävesi, west of Jyväskylä. Put into service in October 2015 as the network's tenth radar, it covers Central Finland, a gap in earlier coverage, and also serves the air force academy at Tikkakoski."
