    "system": "Vaisala WRM200",
    "band": "C",
    "dualPol": true,
    "since": "2021",
    "towerM": null,
    "text": {
      "en": "Stands north of Ylimmäinen in Vihti, near the Loppi border, and covers the Helsinki region and southern Finland. It started operating in July 2021 and replaced the Vantaa radar on the Kaivoksela water tower, which had been the first radar of FMI's network; the new site offers a clearer view."
    },
    "photo": null,
