    "towerM": 30,
    "text": {
      "en": "Stands on the Lakeaharju ridge in Vimpeli, South Ostrobothnia, next to the Lakis ski slopes, and covers western central Finland. The site has been in use since 2005. When the radar was replaced around 2017 and 2018, the old white radome was turned into a meeting room at the ski resort."
